(85, '4ghxzOr8zSLngzwk1uUnPL7Vdv96Ma3bIKEFgjZR', '9820494458', 0, 1846, 1716, '{\"is_existing_website_user\":0,\"user_id\":null,\"profile_id\":null,\"pending_registration_token\":null,\"username\":\"9820494458\",\"fullName\":\"SIDDHANT SANTOSH SHAH\",\"source_of_information\":\"Family\\/Friends\",\"groomOrBride\":\"groom\",\"religion\":\"JAIN\",\"caste\":\"Digambar\",\"subCaste\":\"Dashambar\",\"maritalStatus\":\"Unmarried\",\"birthDate\":\"1998-11-28\",\"height\":\"6ft 2in\",\"weight\":\"71\",\"havingSpecsLenses\":\"None\",\"bloodGroup\":\"O+\",\"motherTongue\":\"MARATHI\",\"language\":\"ENGLISH,HINDI\",\"specialCases\":null,\"knowAboutMyself\":\"I\\u2019m an easy-going, outgoing and jovial person who enjoys meeting people, hosting gatherings and making the most of life. I\\u2019m dynamic, entrepreneurial and helpful by nature, with a strong interest in growing my own business.\\r\\n\\r\\nI have a BA in Economics and a diploma in Fashion, and I run my own photography studio, specialising in corporate events and fashion photography. I\\u2019m passionate about my work and would like to continue growing my career after marriage.\\r\\n\\r\\nOutside of work, I enjoy movies, music and travelling, especially to the mountains. I live with my parents and elder brother, and family is an important part of my life. I value trust, respect and togetherness, and would ideally like to continue living in the same city with a close-knit family that stays together.\\r\\n\\r\\nI\\u2019m looking for an emotionally mature, outgoing and family-oriented partner who has her own aspirations and career. For me, a happy marriage is about mutual respect, supporting each other\\u2019s dreams and building a life we both genuinely want to live. I\\u2019m open to having children and hope to find a partner who is also a friend and companion for life.\",\"address\":\"9-BAHAR ,CHEMBUR UTTAM CHS , ST.ANTHONY\'S ROAD , CHEMBUR, MUMBAI-400071\",\"permanent_address\":\"9-BAHAR ,CHEMBUR UTTAM CHS , ST.ANT