(134, 'OFYWuNsKq2nJg5eIIROsVcSVJ7kOid4LrY45TjTv', '9421364045', 0, 1868, 1737, '{\"is_existing_website_user\":0,\"user_id\":null,\"profile_id\":null,\"pending_registration_token\":null,\"username\":\"9421364045\",\"fullName\":\"SANDESH VINOD JAIN\",\"source_of_information\":\"Family\\/Friends\",\"groomOrBride\":\"groom\",\"religion\":\"JAIN\",\"caste\":\"Digambar\",\"subCaste\":\"Khandelwal\",\"maritalStatus\":\"Unmarried\",\"birthDate\":\"1992-02-02\",\"height\":\"5ft 7in\",\"weight\":\"60\",\"havingSpecsLenses\":\"None\",\"bloodGroup\":\"O+\",\"motherTongue\":\"HINDI\",\"language\":\"English, Marathi\",\"specialCases\":null,\"knowAboutMyself\":\"Jai Jinendra, I\'m Sandesh Jain, 34, from Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar. I hold a B.Com, MBA in Banking & Finance, and DTL. I\'m a cheerful, open-minded person with a good sense of humour and a curious outlook on life. I love exploring new experiences, like currently I\'m training for marathon running and triathlon swimming. I enjoy meeting new people and having meaningful conversations, particularly with those from different professional backgrounds and interests. I\'m also a foodie who enjoys discovering new flavours. In my free time, I like reading books and exploring innovations in technology, especially IT. Coming from a Jain family, I value our traditions while embracing a modern, balanced outlook. I believe in sharing household responsibilities and contributing equally to everyday life.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor me, marriage is a partnership built on friendship, trust, mutual respect, and supporting each other\'s dreams. I\'m looking for a kind-hearted, understanding, and positive-minded life partner who enjoys life\'s little adventures, values togetherness, and believes in growing together.\",\"address\":\"H. No.: 3-7-89, Near gurudwara, Dhawni Mohalla, Shahagunj, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar - 431001\",\"permanent_address\":\"H. No.: 3-7-89, Near gurudwara, Dhawni Mohalla, Shahagunj, Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar - 431001\",\"birth_hou