(232, 'pB9SsMihzaelxrDITOjm6eRv76IpfFkomDmhdPGJ', '9685288611', 0, NULL, NULL, '{\"is_existing_website_user\":0,\"user_id\":null,\"profile_id\":null,\"pending_registration_token\":null,\"username\":\"9685288611\",\"fullName\":\"Jainil Vora\",\"source_of_information\":\"WhatsApp\",\"groomOrBride\":\"groom\",\"religion\":\"Jain\",\"caste\":\"Digambar\",\"subCaste\":\"Any\",\"maritalStatus\":\"Unmarried\",\"birthDate\":\"1993-12-16\",\"height\":\"5ft 11in\",\"weight\":\"72\",\"havingSpecsLenses\":\"None\",\"bloodGroup\":\"O+\",\"motherTongue\":\"Hindi\",\"language\":\"English\",\"specialCases\":\"No\",\"knowAboutMyself\":\"I am a confident, down-to-earth, and family-oriented person who believes in balancing professional ambitions with personal happiness. I am currently working as a Senior Consultant with Capgemini and have a strong interest in continuous learning, personal growth, and building a stable future.\\r\\n\\r\\nI value honesty, mutual respect, understanding, and open communication in a relationship. I believe a successful marriage is built on friendship, trust, and standing by each other through every phase of life.\\r\\n\\r\\nComing from a close-knit family, I respect our traditions and values while also maintaining a modern and practical outlook towards life. In my free time, I enjoy exploring new places, spending quality time with family, and learning new things.\\r\\n\\r\\nI am looking for a compatible life partner who is kind-hearted, understanding, and family-oriented, someone with whom I can share life\'s experiences, support each other\'s dreams, and build a happy and meaningful future together.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor me, marriage is not just about finding a partner, but about finding a best friend with whom to grow, laugh, and create a lifetime of beautiful memories.\",\"address\":\"Pragati park residency wing b flat no 4 1st floor near Sinhagad road\",\"permanent_address\":\"Pragati park residency wing b flat no 4 1st floor near Sinhagad road\",\"birth_hour