(294, 'KTVCyZw22CsCp4aHLMGyQw2zy3CKW3EV9Gtq9VvP', '7350510147', 0, NULL, NULL, '{\"is_existing_website_user\":0,\"user_id\":null,\"profile_id\":null,\"pending_registration_token\":\"7cq4uLgDC5vCuJnNdPgSgzKi2ZaUARauZnXm7hmH\",\"username\":\"7350510147\",\"fullName\":\"Mukul Ashish Mahajan\",\"source_of_information\":\"WhatsApp\",\"groomOrBride\":\"groom\",\"religion\":\"Jain\",\"caste\":\"Digambar\",\"maritalStatus\":\"Unmarried\",\"birthDate\":\"1998-11-09\",\"height\":\"5ft 9in\",\"weight\":\"79\",\"havingSpecsLenses\":\"Yes\",\"bloodGroup\":\"AB+\",\"motherTongue\":\"Marathi\",\"language\":\"English, Hindi\",\"specialCases\":\"NA\",\"knowAboutMyself\":\"I am a B.E. graduate in Computer Science and Engineering, currently working as a Senior Data Engineer at TCS. I would describe myself as a blend of different qualities, with a practical outlook towards life, a caring nature, and a positive attitude. I believe in maintaining a healthy balance between personal and professional life and value the relationships that make life meaningful.\\r\\n\\r\\nFamily holds a special place in my life, and I believe that strong relationships are built on love, trust, understanding, and mutual respect. I appreciate a lifestyle that combines modern thinking with traditional values. In my free time, I enjoy travelling, staying fit, and exploring new experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\nI am looking for a life partner who is kind-hearted, understanding, honest, and supportive, someone with whom I can share a friendship as well as a lifelong bond. I believe a successful marriage is built on open communication, loyalty, respect for each other\\u2019s individuality, and standing by one another through every phase of life. I look forward to building a happy and harmonious life together, where we support each other\\u2019s dreams, cherish family relationships, grow together, and create a future filled with love, trust, and companionship.\",\"address\":\"Green Olive building, Behind Persistent Company, Ch