(411, 'R1U41oKxDhcsTWOvVOG7KnpCIR0OeuuSrGDTJXaY', '9699718107', 1, 786, 655, '{\"is_existing_website_user\":1,\"user_id\":786,\"profile_id\":655,\"pending_registration_token\":null,\"username\":\"9699718107\",\"fullName\":\"Gaurav Sheetal Gandhi\",\"source_of_information\":\"WhatsApp\",\"groomOrBride\":\"groom\",\"religion\":\"Jain\",\"caste\":\"Digambar\",\"maritalStatus\":\"Divorced\",\"birthDate\":\"1990-06-10\",\"height\":\"5ft 9in\",\"weight\":\"65\",\"havingSpecsLenses\":\"Yes\",\"bloodGroup\":\"O+\",\"motherTongue\":\"Marathi\",\"language\":\"Marathi, Hindhi, English, Gujrathi\",\"specialCases\":\"no\",\"knowAboutMyself\":\"Hello, my name is Gaurav S Gandhi. I\'m a 35 year old Software Professionals who is passionate about Software Building. I believe in living life to the fullest and cherishing every moment.\\r\\n\\r\\nFamily and friends are incredibly important to me, and I value honesty, kindness, and empathy in all my relationships. IN a partner, I\'m looking for someone who shares similar values and who is ready to embark on life\'s journey together. I believe in mutual respect, support, and understanding in a relationship. I\'m seeking someone who is ambitious, compassionate, and has a good sense of humour. Outside of work, I enjoy watching movies, exploring new places, reading books, and cooking food.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhether it\'s exploring new places, trying out different cuisines, or simply enjoying a quiet evening at home with a good book or movie, I believe in finding joy in the simple things in life.\\r\\n\\r\\nIf You\'re someone who values genuine connections and is ready to build a meaningful relationship based on trust, love, and respect, I would love to get to know you better.\",\"address\":\"House no 1038, Dwarkamai, 2nd Floor, 2nd main road, RWF colony, Yelahanka New Town, Bangalore, Karnataka.  560064\",\"permanent_address\":\"Sheetal Gandhi, Near Shah Mangal karyalay, Main road, Alan, Gulbarga, Karnataka, 585302\",\"birth_hour\":\"12\",\"birth_