(39, NULL, 'AMN202539', NULL, 'groom', 'Nikhil Dilip Hotpeti', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quick', 'profile_photos/7G9Roe2wOjetm37Y0ymyug7osZA0vZcQmw5kQdRK.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Pancham', 'Unmarried', '1993-06-28', '5ft 7in', '60', 'Yes', 'B+', 'Marathi', 'English Hindi Kannada Marathi', NULL, 'A Software Analyst based in Pune, where I was born and raised. I lead a simple, well-balanced life rooted in family, friendship, work, volunteering, and meditation. For over a decade, I’ve been a regular practitioner of Yoga and Meditation, which have deeply shaped my outlook on life.\r\nOutside of work, I enjoy travelling, cycling, and engaging in community service. I find fulfilment in continuous learning, meaningful conversations, and living mindfully.\r\nI’m looking for a life partner who can be a good friend to me and my family - someone kind, grounded, and open-minded. I value a person for who they are, not their background. My family and I believe in giving space and freedom to pursue one’s passions, goals, and career.', 'Post Graduation', 'Post Graduation Diploma in Advanced Computing', 'BE', 'Advanced Computing', 'Mechanical Engg', 'Pune University', NULL, NULL, 'Pune', 'Engineer', 'IT', 'Cerillion Technologies', 'Pune', 'Operations Analyst', '5', '68000', '800000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Yoga, Meditation, Travelling, Cycling', 'Volunteering for Isha Foundation', 'Multiple academic and professional awards', 'Yoga', 'Basic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'nikhil_hotpeti', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dilip Payappa Hotpeti', 'Yes', 'Deepal Dilip Hotpeti', 'Yes', 'Barshi dist Solapur MH', 'Chartered Accountant', NULL, 'Talikoti dist Vijayapura KA', 'Homemaker', NULL, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'No', NULL, 'Modern', 'Upper', NULL, 'Dilip Payappa Hotpeti', 'Father', 'Srimandhar Kumar Surpur', 'Uncle', 'Bangaluru KA', '9886032450', NULL, 'uploads/Av4apjDIc2hVoRunowKbaAwm8wFbEu