(564, 'MM2-0299', 'MM2-0299', 'C235', 'groom', 'Siddharth Nitin Jain', 'snjainpune@gmail.com', 'WhatsApp', '8237300656', 'melava', 'uploads/Q7q1bC2qBTpAHnhCFVSOKcSGg07yEmyGTvpPSG6l.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Any', 'Unmarried', '1992-10-21', '5ft 5in', '63', 'None', 'A+', 'Marathi', 'English, Marathi, Hindi', NULL, 'I am based out of Pune, India, and people lovingly call me as \'Sid\'.\r\n\r\nI have pursued my B.Tech in Electronics and Tele-Communication Engineering from College of Engineering Pune (COEP). I was the Gold Medalist from my batch (2014). Being passionate about Finance, I pursued and successfully completed the CFA program (CFA Institute, USA), one of the toughest exams in the world. I am a CFA Charterholder since 2019, considered as the gold standard in the Finance industry. I have also completed MBA in Finance and Marketing and PGDCA during the pandemic.\r\n\r\nI am a Finance professional (FinTech) and work as a Product Owner/Manager. Currently, I am employed as a Vice President with the Citi Bank (leading US Bank). I have worked with different MNCs such as the Deutsche Bank Group (largest German Bank), Barclays (largest UK Bank) and Credit Suisse (leading Swiss Bank) before joining Citi Bank Group.\r\n\r\nAs a person, I am caring and have a strong sense of belonging towards my family ties. Even though I have a modern mindset, I believe in all the traditional values. I am a foodie. In my free time, I love yoga, travelling, and gardening a lot. I have booked my flat near my office, and will be shifting there in the near future.\r\n\r\nSomeone who comes from a diverse background, is simple, well-educated, caring, understanding, fair & smart, and gives importance to ethics, values and principles would be an ideal match. If you think we can get along, please feel free to contact and express your interest.', 'Post Graduation', 'Gold Medalist, B.Tech in E&TC Engineering from COEP Tech University', 'CFA Charterholder from CFA Institute USA', 'Technology', 'Finance', 'COEP Tech University and CFA Institute USA', 'MBA in Finance and Marketing', 'Post Graduate Diploma in Computer Applications', 'Pune', 'Leader in FinTech sector (IT industry in Finance)', 'IT Department in Banking and Financial Services sector', 'Citi Group (Leading US Bank), Pune', 'Pune', 'Vice President and Product Owner', '~12 years', '500000', 'Above INR 61 Lakhs', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Traveling, Trekking, Foodie', 'Volunteer at the Art of Living', 'Recipient of Maharashtra State Merit Scholarship and Dhirubhai Ambani Foundation Scholarship', 'Yoga and Meditation', 'Basic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pune', '03:54:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nitin Jain', 'Yes', 'Parinita Jain', 'Yes', 'Parola, Jalgaon, Maharashtra', 'Stock Broker and Investment Consultant', '9284663424', 'Paranda, Osmanabad, Maharashtra', 'Housewife', '9356258979', 1, 0, 0, NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Liberal', 'Upper', 'Above INR 36 Lakhs', 'Siddharth Nitin Jain', 'Self', 'Nitin Jain', 'Father', 'Anant Bunglow, 55/1, Patwardhan Baug Society, Gulawani Maharaj Road, Erandwane, Pune-411004', '9284663424', 'njainpune@gmail.com', 'uploads/PNGRSxAKvCbzRHeB9v3hFIWD4zHyRpcj29JgPb41.jpg', 'uploads/dCNjbZOMScespiK6J5D3Z27UlbSPOdkddDgK7snp.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"additional_photos\\/qIU4U3lDBPmWzuQt1ivo6V6CqL6K7vho3VMH1FAL.jpg\",\"additional_photos\\/NzOAcjA44XbMkkgrPQot52NPXMgh7EQDv3u4r1Up.png\",\"additional_photos\\/Gwif5bkM3WJiUDZUuYLz1nARlC5U43DARVbmtDGd.png\"]', 'Completed', 61, 'active', '2026-05-19 18:41:39', '2026-06-30 04:25:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Anant Bunglow, 55/1, Patwardhan Baug Society, Erandwane, Pune - 411004', 'Anant Bunglow, 55/1, Patwardhan Baug Society, Erandwane, Pune - 411004', 'AM', NULL),
