(952, 'MM2-0645', 'MM2-0645', 'C154', 'groom', 'Tejas Ukalkar', 'utu8811@gmail.com', 'WhatsApp', '7588125098', 'melava', 'uploads/X0ZpOjRmxjEno1eqUGEw5fRXoIX3m4rV7HQswpL0.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Saitwal', 'Unmarried', '1994-02-28', '5ft 7in', '58', 'Yes', 'AB+', 'Marathi', 'Hindi, English, Japanese', NULL, 'Hi, I\'m Tejas, a software engineer who believes in honesty, openness, self-awareness, and treating others with kindness and respect. I value meaningful relationships, continuous learning, and helping others whenever I can.\r\nStaying healthy and fit is an important part of my lifestyle. I enjoy regular exercise, practicing yoga, and maintaining a balanced approach to physical and mental well-being. For me, good health goes hand in hand with strong family values and a positive outlook on life.\r\nI am naturally curious and enjoy reading non-fiction books that help me learn and grow. In my free time, I like writing poems, playing the guitar, and roller skating. I appreciate personal growth, meaningful conversations, and experiences that broaden my perspective.\r\nI am looking for a kind, respectful, and career-oriented life partner with whom I can build a strong bond based on trust, understanding, and shared values. I hope to find someone who believes in supporting each other\'s aspirations as we learn, grow, and create a happy and fulfilling life together.', 'Graduation', 'Bachelor\'s of Engineering', NULL, 'CE', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nanded', 'Software Engineer', 'IT', 'Torus Group', 'Pune', 'Frontend Developer', '3 years', '50000', '600000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Reading Books, Poetry, Drawing & Playing Guitar', 'Volunteering', NULL, 'Roller Skating', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'tejasukalkar', 'Tejas Ukalkar Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Parbhani', '07:10:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ulhas Ukalkar', 'Yes', 'Suchita Ukalkar', 'Yes', 'Narsi Namdev', 'Insurance Advisor',