(953, 'MM2-0646', 'MM2-0646', 'A154', 'bride', 'Snehal Tushikant Sangole', 'snehalsangole36@gmail.com', 'WhatsApp', '8080092518', 'melava', 'uploads/j2RAvdbaQBDGc7EvuRGsu9EHiexZdoDwPYtrcbe4.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Saitwal', 'Unmarried', '1999-09-16', '5ft 2in', '58', 'No', 'B+', 'Marathi', 'Hindi and English', NULL, 'I’m a 26-year-old Civil Engineer with 4 years of professional experience, currently working with axis consultants in Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar. I’m positive, easygoing, and believe in living life with gratitude, sincerity, and a good sense of humor.\r\nI enjoy travelling. While I’m passionate about my career, I also value family, relationships, and the simple joys of life.\r\nI value mutual respect, trust, and understanding in a relationship. I’m looking for a caring, grounded, and family-oriented partner who values relationships, embraces traditions, and believes in growing together.', 'Graduation', 'Civil Engineering', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar', 'Civil Engineer', 'Civil', 'axis consultants', 'Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar', 'Architect', '4 years', '38000', '500000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I cook well', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', NULL, NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Latur', '03:27:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tushikant Sangole', 'Yes', 'Supriya Sangole', 'Yes', 'Shirur Anantpal', 'Buisness', '9421452092', 'Latur', 'Housewife', '8080092518', 1, 0, 1, 0, 'No', NULL, 'Liberal', 'Middle', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ishwar Kondekar', 'Uncle', 'Narsinh chowk, Main road, Shirur Anantpal, Dist. Latur', '9834031325', 'snehalsangole36@gmail.com', 'uploads/vXu5iYPB6kw6DUoMGUxReWkdxMtCuxiz6VolWtW4.jpg', 'uploads/vBVcOAWACAHOyPzg7CXMFKSkvJX7NOvNz4zPB1nV.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"additional_photos\\/wHd56ADU7wY6S5Awmw4zRuCsZVZbjzP8RKcT0Tl5.jpg\"]', 'Completed', 55, 'active', '2026-05-26 11:35:11', '2026-06-24 12:09: