(989, 'MM2-0681', 'MM2-0681', 'E113', 'groom', 'Abhishek oswal', 'abhishek.oswal1@gmail.com', 'People References', '9766878286', 'melava', 'uploads/fRM2wFgWDRuULNK2UbdbxqoDwOzHy5Axn1tY7fAK.jpg', 'Shwetambar', NULL, 'Divorced', '1993-05-30', '5ft 8in', '80', 'Yes', 'O+', 'Marwari', 'Hindi English Marathi', NULL, 'I am a grounded and easy-going individual currently working as a distributor and wholesaler of FMCG products. I hold a B.E. (Electronics and Telecommunication) degree and believe in continuous growth, both professionally and personally. I am supported by a very close-knit family and value living life authentically. My passions include listening to music and the simple pleasure of taking my car out for long drives to unwind and explore new places. While my previous marriage ended, I have approached the experience with maturity and I am now excited to find my life partner.', 'Graduation', 'Bachelor of engineering', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shop', 'FMCG', 'Krupa Genera store', 'Lonavala', NULL, NULL, '0000.000', NULL, 'INR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Parasmal Chhogmalji Oswal', 'No', 'Vimala Parasmal oswal', 'Yes', 'Arthwada', NULL, NULL, 'Sheoganj', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 4, 3, 'No', NULL, 'Modern', 'Middle', NULL, 'Abhishek oswal', 'Self', 'Dipali Jain', 'Sister', 'Meenakshi society, lodha corner pune 411 037', '9763306609', 'dipsposwal@gmail.com', 'uploads/3ihCwWCQ8zHS3VrRdSzxqCc7DQYmgadSFStpYTQD.jpg', 'uploads/81CSxkwKeeuc5wt1TrtCV4QPn6FpFLKws9TeMcm2.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"additional_photos\\/ym8fD8byKsZg1gAgGN24rxZENMns1co3vjtnHU7O.jpg\",\"additional_photos\\/oJmiDhsiYg8E0PQHk27ZQcnJkzt7xhonuwgwUEeU.jpg\",\"additional_photos\\/1AduRUo7YcbzaVIwqxvcYMfkZksPNwf8lq7H5Pq6.jpg\",\"additional_photos\\/4ZNzti9HLko2hfXLrw7uer