(990, 'MM2-0682', 'MM2-0682', 'C144', 'groom', 'Ankit Kailash Kankariya', 'moderntiles2024@gmail.com', 'Instagram', '9768692338', 'melava', 'uploads/6QUEno0ScO7jtml0Ll9FLQ0ir8n6KOjJA8hrR1gh.jpg', 'Shwetambar', 'Any', 'Unmarried', '1992-06-23', '5ft 9in', '70', 'Yes', 'O+', 'Hindi', 'Marwadi gujrati english marathi', NULL, 'I am a Civil Engineering graduate with an entrepreneurial spirit, actively running our family business in partnership with my father and\r\nyounger brother across construction material trading, industrial supply, and real estate development. My values are deeply rooted in Jainism\r\n— I studied at Shree Parshwapradnalay Gyan Sanskar Mandir Jain Boarding, Talegaon (Pune) from the 8th to 10th standard, an\r\nexperience that shaped my outlook profoundly. I follow a Jain diet and our family has gradually adopted the same — we are a vegetarian\r\nhousehold at heart. Beyond work, I love travelling, discovering new cuisines, cinema, and quiet moments of spiritual reflection. Our family is\r\ngenuinely inclined towards philanthropy — we believe giving is not just a duty but a joy.', 'Graduation', 'Civil engineer', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Navi Mumbai', 'Business', NULL, 'Vision ventures & modern tiles', 'Navi Mumbai', 'Owner', NULL, 'NA', NULL, 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Travelling music', NULL, NULL, 'Swimming yoga', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'ankitshah009', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ankit Shah', 'Yes', 'Ankit Shah', 'Yes', 'Falna khudala', 'Business', NULL, 'Limdi', 'Home maker', NULL, 1, 1, 0, NULL, 'No', NULL, 'Liberal', 'Middle', '1.5 cr', 'Ankit Shah', 'Self', 'Ankit Shah', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'moderntiles2024@gmail.com', 'uploads/ALIwg63uOYLoHvXUdE5GRA3s716BYFijCdLixaQR.png', 'uploads/tGpTCjdFJH0zGNII2n2zE9TT01eo6RIn69ANyyuP.png', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[\"additional_photos\\/JhkVTjl98sH7NLor8XRQ