(1107, 'MM2-0783', 'MM2-0783', 'C121', 'groom', 'Abhishek Sunil Chougule', 'csabhishek1008@gmail.com', 'Instagram', '9960160200', 'melava', 'uploads/0IyaydD9WhR3tqhgNnD338SeL0r7DDZ0yWlcdtk2.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Chaturth', 'Unmarried', '1992-03-03', '5ft 3in', '55', 'No', 'B+', 'Marathi', 'Hindi, Kannada, English', NULL, 'Hi, my name is Abhishek. I am originally from Jaysingpur(Kolhapur ditrict) Maharashtra and currently working as a Software Engineer in an MNC. I have around 5 years of experience in the IT industry and work in Application Development, primarily on cloud and front end  & devops technologies.\r\n\r\nRegarding my education, I have completed my Bachelor of Engineering. Professionally, I am career-oriented and ambitious, but I also believe in maintaining a healthy work-life balance.\r\n\r\nComing to my family, we are a close-knit family with good values. My mother is working as an Assistant Teacher at a secondary high school. My elder brother and sister-in-law are both software engineers and are currently working in the IT industry. We are a well-educated family that values mutual respect, strong relationships, and a balanced approach towards traditional and modern values.\r\n\r\nAs a person, I would describe myself as calm, practical, responsible, and family-oriented. In my free time, I enjoy learning new technologies, exploring business ideas, financial planning/investing, traveling, and spending quality time with family.\r\n\r\nFor the future, I value mutual understanding, respect, and companionship in marriage. I am looking for a well-educated, understanding, caring, and family-oriented life partner with compatible values. I believe marriage is about growing together, supporting each other, and building a happy family life.', 'Graduation', 'Bachelor of Engineering', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Software Engineer', 'IT', NULL, 'Pune', 'Software engineer', '5 years', '100000', '1400000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Traveling, learning new technolog