(1135, 'MM3-0145', 'MM3-0145', 'A3 057', 'groom', 'Siddharth Prakash Jamdade', 'pbjamadade@gmail.com', 'WhatsApp', '9422043641', 'existing', 'uploads/profile_photos/1791709358_profile_IMG-20251026-WA0062.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Chaturth', 'Unmarried', '1999-05-09', '6ft 0in', '72', 'Yes', 'B+', 'Marathi', 'English, Hindi, Kannada', 'No', 'I am a 27-year-old ambitious, grounded, and family-oriented individual with a background in Textile Engineering. Currently, I work as a Senior Software Engineer at Volkswagen Group Digital Solutions India Pvt. Ltd. I am passionate about continuous learning and personal growth, and I strive to maintain a healthy balance between my professional ambitions and personal life.\r\n\r\nBy nature, I am an ambivert—someone who enjoys meaningful social interactions while also valuing personal time and reflection. Friends and family describe me as humble, dependable, caring, and disciplined. I follow a healthy lifestyle as a pure vegetarian and a non-smoker/non-drinker. I strongly believe in honesty, mutual respect, and maintaining meaningful relationships. Family holds a very important place in my life, and I value traditions while embracing a progressive outlook.\r\n\r\nOutside of work, I enjoy cooking, travelling, trekking, and exploring new places and experiences. I am a fitness enthusiast who regularly goes to the gym and enjoys playing cricket and badminton. I also enjoy watching movies and web series, trying different cuisines, exploring new technologies, and spending quality time with friends and family.\r\n\r\nProfessionally, I am currently building my career in the IT industry and enjoy the opportunities for learning and growth it offers. At the same time, I have a family business that I may choose to take a more active role in at a suitable stage of life, depending on future opportunities and circumstances. As a result, there may be a possibility of relocating to my hometown in the future. I believe important life decisions should be made together with mutual understanding and respect.\r\n\r\nI deeply respect professional aspirations and would fully support my partner in pursuing her career goals. Whether she chooses to continue in her profession, work remotely, explore entrepreneurship, contribute to the family business, or follow her own ambitions, I believe in encouraging each other’s growth and making decisions as a team.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a kind-hearted, understanding, and family-oriented life partner who values honesty, trust, and open communication. Someone with a calm and positive nature, who appreciates meaningful relationships and companionship, would be an ideal match. As I share a close bond with my family and friends, I would appreciate a partner who is understanding of these relationships and comfortable in a warm and supportive joint family environment.\r\n\r\nI believe marriage is a lifelong partnership built on friendship, mutual respect, trust, and supporting each other through every phase of life. My goal is to build a happy, fulfilling, and harmonious life together with a partner who shares similar values and outlooks.', 'Graduation', 'B. Tech (Textile Technology)', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'DKTE, Shivaji University,', 'NA', 'NA', 'Ichalkaranji', 'Engineer', 'IT', 'Volkswagen Group Digital Solutions India, Pune', 'Pune', 'Senior Software Engineer', '4 years', '125000', '1500000', 'INR', '125000.00', '1500000.00', 'Traveling, Trekking, Reading, Cooking', 'Volunteering', 'NA', 'Cricket', 'Basic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', '@siddharthjamdade', 'https://www.facebook.com/share/18jWw2HP2e/?mibextid=wwXIfr', 'NA', 'NA', 'NA', 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ichalkaranji', '13:15:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Prakash Bapu Jamdade', 'Yes', 'Sunanda Prakash Jamdade', 'Yes', 'Ichalkaranji', 'Textile Business (Fabric Manufacturing)', '9422043641', 'A/P. Dattwad, Taluka - Shirol, Dist. - Kolhapur', 'Home maker', '9850638247', 0