(1252, 'MM2-0908', 'MM2-0908', 'E158', 'groom', 'Sagar Sanjay Murde', 'sagarmurde@gmail.com', 'Instagram', '9075090968', 'melava', 'profile_photos/ToA31cs7JQjnyI9cOBCUVBRWg4hF1g3ePGDDtcF6.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Pancham', 'Divorced', '1990-12-08', '6ft 0in', '9075090968', 'No', 'A-', 'Marathi', 'English, Hindi', NULL, 'I enjoy being around people and believe in living life with positivity.I am usually described as an ambitious and career-oriented person.I am a simple, god fearing, caring, understanding human being.\r\n\r\nI have a passion for traveling.I find happiness in reading.\r\n\r\nI am currently settled in Pune working with Tech Mahindra Limited as a Project Lead - IT. Before that I had completed my MBA from Bharti Vidypeeth\'s Institute of Management & Research.\r\n\r\nOurs is a moderate family based out of Solapur, with a perfect balance of traditional and modern thoughts.\r\n\r\nI would like my life partner to presume that marriage is a journey undertaken with mutual understanding and respect.I am progressive in my thought process, so looking someone with whom I can share my life goals.My life partner should most importantly be my best friend, who I feel comfortable with.', 'Post Graduation', 'MBA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pune', 'Job', 'IT Networking', 'Tech Mahindra', 'Pune', 'Assistant Manager', '11', '200000', '2400000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Treking, book reading', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', 'No', 'No', 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mumbai', '11:40:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sanjay Murde', 'Yes', 'Pranita Murde', 'Yes', 'Solapur', 'Retire', '8007881000', 'Mumbai', 'Housewife', '9075090968', 0, NULL, 2, 0, 'No', NULL, 'Modern', 'Middle', NULL, 'Sagar Sanjay Murde', 'Self', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'Mumbai', '9075090968', 'sagarmurde@gmail.com', 'uploads/MmLVZMT66LFaoc669ubgBpBL4mI4WuZ7ZOAfDnQb.pdf', 'uploads/nKKd9WCSIatwP159xJsD9r21lGn7A4Bl9toWgSIQ