(1387, 'MM2-1031', 'MM2-1031', 'B495', 'groom', 'Pratik Ravindra Tikait', 'pratiktikait187@gmail.com', 'Poster/Flex in Temple', '9503280108', 'melava', 'uploads/9eLIgvem7rxmZy4WLrWOGXJccuvda7dBleggph0a.jpg', 'Digambar', 'Any', 'Unmarried', '1996-10-19', '5ft 6in', '63', 'None', 'AB+', 'Marathi', 'Hindi', NULL, 'Jai Jinendra 🙏\r\n\r\nLet me briefly introduce myself. I’ll also be happy to share my biodata with you.\r\n\r\nMy name is Pratik Tikait. I have completed my engineering and MBA. I have been working at HSBC since 2021. Currently, I work as a Senior Software Developer. Along with my corporate role, I am also a certified yoga instructor and a calisthenics coach. I provide personal training both online and offline. At present, I am working with 7 clients and have trained 65+ clients so far.\r\n\r\nI am also exploring travel content creation, as I truly enjoy traveling. So far, I have visited 7 countries and look forward to exploring many more.\r\n\r\nI live in Pune with my family—my parents and my brother and sister-in-law. We have our own penthouse here in Pune.\r\n\r\nTo share a bit about my family background: my father is a retired Senior PWD Engineer from the government sector and is currently actively involved in farming as well. My brother works in the IT industry as a Manager at Sapiens. My sister-in-law is a government doctor and also runs her own clinic. My mother is a homemaker.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a partner who shares similar values—someone who is respectful, caring, goal-oriented, and family-oriented. I would be happy to hear from you if you’re interested in taking this conversation forward.', 'Post Graduation', 'MBA in business analytics', 'BE in computer Science', 'Diploma in electronics and telecommunications', NULL, 'SPPU', 'Certified yoga instructor', 'Certified Calisthenics Coach', 'Pune', 'Software Developer', 'IT', 'HSBC', 'Pune', 'Sr software engineer', '5', '100000', '370000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Travelling playing different games', 'Vol