(1580, 'MM3-0028', 'MM3-0028', 'B3 078', 'groom', 'Sanket Vaibhav Mehta', 'sanketvmehta@outlook.com', 'Family/Friends', '9850666968', 'melava', 'uploads/profile_photos/1790236451_profile_sanket.JPEG', 'Digambar', 'Dashambar', 'Unmarried', '1993-12-22', '5ft 8in', '65', 'None', 'A+', 'Marathi', 'English, Hindi', NULL, 'I’m a Research Scientist at Google DeepMind (USA), working on the cutting edge of AI. I’m incredibly grateful for my academic journey—from the President’s Gold Medal at IIT Roorkee to my Ph.D. at CMU—but at my core, I’m just someone who appreciates the simple things in life.\r\n\r\nMy weekends are a mix of pushing limits and completely unplugging. You’ll usually find me lacing up for a half-marathon, hiking, or biking. I’m also always hunting down the perfect vada pav or a thin crispy dosa, with a masala chai on the side.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a kind, career-driven partner to share this journey with. I value family deeply and stick to a vegetarian lifestyle. If you are someone who enjoys balancing career goals with Sunday morning chai runs, we would be a great match.', 'Post Graduation', 'Ph.D.', 'B.Tech (IIT Roorkee)', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Computer Science', 'Carnegie Mellon University', NULL, NULL, 'Pittsburgh, USA', 'Research/ Engineer', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Google', 'Mountain View (California, USA)', 'Senior Research Scientist', '3', '1', NULL, 'INR', '1.00', NULL, 'Running, Biking', NULL, 'President\'s Gold Medal (IIT Roorkee)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Lonand, Maharashtra, India', '09:57:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Vaibhav Mehta', 'Yes', 'Swati Mehta', 'Yes', 'Vadgaon Nimbalkar, Baramati, Pune', 'Business & Agriculture', '9850666968', NULL, 'Business', '9822803252', 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'No', NULL, '', '', NULL, 'Sanket Vaibhav Mehta', 'Self', 'Dr. Sujal Sahil Shah', 'Sister', 'Mumbai', '992114841