(1719, 'MM3-0259', 'MM3-0259', 'C3 021', 'bride', 'Priya Chandrakant Arage', NULL, 'Family/Friends', '9960157767', 'melava', 'uploads/profile_photos/1792344781_profile_IMG_0983.jpeg', 'Digambar', 'Pancham', 'Unmarried', '1990-12-26', '5ft 2in', '51', 'None', 'A+', 'Marathi', 'English, Hindi, Kannada', '', 'I’m Priya Arage, originally from Kolhapur, Maharashtra, and currently based in Hyderabad where I work as a Senior manager in Regulatory Affairs with Sandoz Pharmaceuticals. I hold a Master’s degree in Pharmacy, and my career is something I take pride in, as it allows me to contribute meaningfully while also growing professionally.\r\n\r\nBeyond work, I believe in living a cheerful and balanced life. I am a certified international yoga trainer, and yoga is an integral part of my daily routine, it keeps me grounded and centered. I am also a classical Kathak artist, which connects me deeply to Indian culture and tradition. Creativity is important to me, and I find joy in sketching portraits, cooking homemade meals, and exploring new places. Traveling, whether solo or with new people has given me wonderful experiences and perspectives. When I want to relax, I enjoy watching comedy shows that bring laughter into my day.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a partner who shares similar values, someone who follows a vegetarian lifestyle, is supportive of career aspirations, and believes in mutual growth. Flexibility and understanding are key to me in a relationship, and I am open to relocating if needed. I believe that when two people respect each other’s individuality while growing together, they can build a strong and fulfilling bond.', 'Post Graduation', 'Masters in Pharmacy', '', 'Quality Assurance', '', '', 'Bachelors in Psychology', 'International Certified Yoga Trainer', 'Kolhapur', 'Senior Manager in Regulatory Affairs', 'medical', 'Sandoz Pvt ltd', 'Hyderabad', 'Senior Manager', '7', '1.5 - 2 lacs', '2900000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Sketching portraits, Painting, cooking', 'Vol