(1833, 'MM3-0432', 'MM3-0432', 'A3 196', 'groom', 'Mukul Ashish Mahajan', NULL, 'WhatsApp', '7350510147', 'melava', 'uploads/profile_photos/1792814517_profile_IMG_3166.jpeg', 'Digambar', '', 'Unmarried', '1998-11-09', '5ft 9in', '79', 'Yes', 'AB+', 'Marathi', 'English, Hindi', 'NA', 'I am a B.E. graduate in Computer Science and Engineering, currently working as a Senior Data Engineer at TCS. I would describe myself as a blend of different qualities, with a practical outlook towards life, a caring nature, and a positive attitude. I believe in maintaining a healthy balance between personal and professional life and value the relationships that make life meaningful.\r\n\r\nFamily holds a special place in my life, and I believe that strong relationships are built on love, trust, understanding, and mutual respect. I appreciate a lifestyle that combines modern thinking with traditional values. In my free time, I enjoy travelling, staying fit, and exploring new experiences.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a life partner who is kind-hearted, understanding, honest, and supportive, someone with whom I can share a friendship as well as a lifelong bond. I believe a successful marriage is built on open communication, loyalty, respect for each other’s individuality, and standing by one another through every phase of life. I look forward to building a happy and harmonious life together, where we support each other’s dreams, cherish family relationships, grow together, and create a future filled with love, trust, and companionship.', 'Graduation', 'Bachelor Of Engineering', '', 'Computer Science & Engineering', '', 'Prof. Ram Meghe Institute of Technology & Research, Badnera – Amravati', '', '', 'Amravati', 'Engineer', 'IT', 'Tata Consultancy Services', 'Pune', 'Sr. Data Engineer', '5.4', '85000', '12 LPA', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Travel, Fitness, Movies', '', 'Received Many Certificates During Work From Project Clients', 'Cricket, Gym', 'Basic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'No', '', '