(1834, 'MM3-0433', 'MM3-0433', 'A3 197', 'groom', 'Naman Pramod mutha', NULL, 'WhatsApp', '8830384821', 'melava', 'uploads/profile_photos/1792778463_profile_1000790867.jpg', 'Shwetambar', 'Any', 'Unmarried', '2000-11-05', '5ft 6in', '70', 'None', 'B+', 'Marwadi', 'Hindi, English, marathi,', '', 'I am a person who is driven to do something extraordinary in life, I want to build something really huge in size in business, i like people who are ambitious and only hang around people who hate incompetence in life. I value simple things in life like family, friends but at the same time understand that if you are privileged then it is your primary responsibility to contribute as much as you can to society. You have one life and I want to make the most out of it, I want to travel, make a lot of friends and explore all that is there to know about this tiny world, I want to know how the world works and have a deep sense of understanding of why things are the way they are. Also I believe in taking huge risks in life, because one life at the end of it.', 'Graduation', 'BBA- IB', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Business', 'F&B manufacturing', 'Pramod food products', 'Pune', 'Owner, CEO', '6', '250000', '3000000', 'INR', NULL, NULL, 'Reading, biking, triathlon running, dancing', '', 'Award in business excellence', 'Running', 'Basic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Yes', 'Muthanaman000', '', '', '', '', 'Jain', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pune', '03:20:00', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pramod motilal mutha', 'Yes', 'Madhubala pramod mutha', 'Yes', 'Pune', 'Business', '9850711251', 'Pune', 'House wife', '9766652294', 0, NULL, 1, 1, 'No', '', 'Liberal', 'Upper', '4500000', 'Naman mutha', 'Self', 'Anand nahar', 'Mamaji', 'Warje pune', '9552912666', '', 'uploads/melava_documents/1792778463_idproof_Screenshot_20261023_173733_WhatsApp.jpg', 'uploads/melava_documents/1792778463_birthproof_20261023_230654.jpg', NULL, 'uploads/melava_documents/179